      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠠᠷᠳᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bardaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бардах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BARDA-</transcript>
      <definition>v, 1. To boast, brag; to be proud, vainglorious; to give oneself airs; to be sure or overconfident of one's intentions or about one's success.</definition>
      <page>85</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠠᠶᠠᠨ ᠎ᠳᠠᠭᠠᠨ ᠪᠠᠷᠳᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>bajan daγan --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To be arrogant because of one's wealth.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
